From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Open Arc Authors <dev@openarc.invalid>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:44:09 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] openarc: embedder: switch the password leak check on and off

OACApplication gains -isPasswordBreachCheckEnabled / -setPasswordBreachCheckEnabled:,
a plain switch read at each sign-in. The shell sets it at launch from its own
Settings toggle (B235).
